  "Lead time, hours": "Kuyobora igihe, amasaha",
  "Leave a colour blank to keep the one True Grit ships with — clearing a field is how you undo. A page or country's colours start from the site colours and override only what you change, so each is a short list, not a second palette to maintain. When both apply to the same visitor, the page wins — an editorial page's design should not be undone by a geo experiment.":
    "Kureka ibara ryuzuye kugirango ugumane ubwato bumwe True Grit hamwe - gusiba umurima nuburyo usubiramo. Urupapuro cyangwa amabara yigihugu bitangirira kumabara yurubuga hanyuma ukarenga gusa ibyo uhinduye, buriwese rero nurutonde rugufi, ntabwo palette ya kabiri yo kubungabunga. Iyo byombi bisabye umushyitsi umwe, page iratsinda - igishushanyo mbonera cyurupapuro nticyakuweho nubushakashatsi bwa geo.",
  "Leave blank to use the default.": "Kureka ubusa kugirango ukoreshe ibisanzwe.",
  "Leave the link blank for a plain, unclickable image.":
    "Kureka ihuriro ubusa kubishusho byoroshye, bidashobora gukururwa.",
  "Less refunds": "Gusubizwa make",
  "Lets customers apply a gift card code at checkout, covering part or all of their order total. Issue cards from the Gift Cards page. Off by default — existing cards and their balances are kept, just not redeemable, while this is off.":
    "Reka abakiriya bashireho ikarita yimpano kode kuri cheque, ikubiyemo igice cyangwa ibyo batumije byose. Tanga amakarita kuva kurupapuro rwimpano. Kureka kubisanzwe - amakarita ariho hamwe nuburinganire bwabo burabikwa, gusa ntibishobora gucungurwa, mugihe ibi birahari.",
  "Lets customers narrow the shop grid by dietary tag (Vegan, Gluten Free, ...) and certification. Reads tags and certifications already assigned to products in the product editor — off just hides the filter checkboxes, nothing assigned is lost.":
    "Kureka abakiriya bagabanye iduka ryamaduka akoresheje ibiryo (Vegan, Gluten Free, ...) hamwe nicyemezo. Soma ibirango na seritifika zimaze kugenerwa ibicuruzwa mubanditsi b'ibicuruzwa - kuzimya gusa uhisha akayunguruzo gasanduku, nta kintu cyahawe cyatakaye.",
  "Lets customers set up recurring cash-on-delivery deliveries of a product from its product page. Off by default and not needed at launch — existing subscriptions are kept and viewable in Subscriptions, just not renewed, while this is off.":
    "Kureka abakiriya bashiraho amafaranga asubiramo-kugemura ibicuruzwa biva kurupapuro rwibicuruzwa. Hanze byanze bikunze kandi ntibikenewe mugutangiza - abiyandikishije bariho barabikwa kandi bareba mubiyandikishije, gusa ntabwo byavuguruwe, mugihe ibi birahari.",
